# EXAMPLE ONLY — placeholders. Copy to `.naming-denylist` and replace with real terms.
#
# `.naming-denylist` is gitignored and holds plaintext for local runs.
# CI uses SIGNET_NAMING_SALT plus the digests in conformance/rules/naming-denylist.json.
#
# One term per line, lower case. Unigrams and bigrams are both matched, so
# "firstname surname" and "surname" are separate entries.
#
# Add each real term to the committed manifest with:
#   SIGNET_NAMING_SALT=… node conformance/rules/check-naming.js . --add "<term>"
# The term itself is never written to the repository.

acme-corporation
acme corp
example-implementer
firstname surname
surname
